><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-12T15:05:18-08:00","id":1428213,"title":"","content":"I've now added<b> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/339728/These-Pages-Are-Knives-Turtle-Style\" target=\"_blank\">Turtle Style</a></b> to the Vault.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-15T14:05:54-08:00","id":1428507,"title":"","content":"I'm not especially knowledgeable about game balance, but I seem to recall that Charms which let you hit multiple targets with a single withering attack usually put some kind of limit on how much initiative the attacker can gain (like Circle of Bright Reaving).<br /> <br /> Spinning Shell Assault seems pretty damned strong without that sort of clause, although I guess it might not be as amazing as it sounds since there aren't a lot of other offensive Charms in the style to apply along with it (as compared to all of Solar Melee).<br /> <br /> This style is very cool in any case, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11237-jefepato","name":"Jefepato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-15T17:19:29-08:00","id":1428531,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jefepato</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1409845-these-pages-are-knives-new-martial-arts-book?p=1428507#post1428507\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not especially knowledgeable about game balance, but I seem to recall that Charms which let you hit multiple targets with a single withering attack usually put some kind of limit on how much initiative the attacker can gain (like Circle of Bright Reaving).<br /> <br /> Spinning Shell Assault seems pretty damned strong without that sort of clause, although I guess it might not be as amazing as it sounds since there aren't a lot of other offensive Charms in the style to apply along with it (as compared to all of Solar Melee).<br /> <br /> This style is very cool in any case, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm glad to hear you like it! I'll take your feedback into consideration; I'd like to hear whether it seems too strong once it's been used more in practice (since you do have to hit three different people on a penalized roll to get the triple Initiative harvest), and I can make changes if it turns out that it is too strong after all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-18T21:42:27-08:00","id":1428985,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rand Brittain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1409845-these-pages-are-knives-new-martial-arts-book?p=1428531#post1428531\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm glad to hear you like it! I'll take your feedback into consideration; I'd like to hear whether it seems too strong once it's been used more in practice (since you do have to hit three different people on a penalized roll to get the triple Initiative harvest), and I can make changes if it turns out that it is too strong after all.</div> </div> </div> </div>A penalized roll? I thought it was the enemies' Defenses that were penalized.<br /> <br /> I, uh, suppose it seems a little less excessive now. &gt;_&gt;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11237-jefepato","name":"Jefepato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-19T09:56:31-08:00","id":1429034,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jefepato</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1409845-these-pages-are-knives-new-martial-arts-book?p=1428985#post1428985\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A penalized roll? I thought it was the enemies' Defenses that were penalized.<br /> <br /> I, uh, suppose it seems a little less excessive now. &gt;_&gt;</div> </div> </div> </div>You'll be dropping successes off the attack roll, which is even more of a factor. It's definitely very powerful if you have three targets to hit, and you manage to smack all three even when you need three extra successes to get the last one (and because that one gets the biggest soak reduction you're likely to want the toughest one to eat the biggest penalty if you want), but it's not likely to actually all line up that many times in practice.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-19T10:06:52-08:00","id":1429037,"title":"","content":"Looking the matter over, this was legitimately poor wording on my part, so I've uploaded a new file that phrases the matter more clearly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T12:04:25-08:00","id":1429401,"title":"","content":"I've enjoyed some of your previous works. If a player had a specific concept in mind I'd definitely point them at this collection. <br /> <br /> As an aside are you considering writing a pdf for sorcery spells? Sorcery is terribly under-served both officially and 3rd party. I'd like to see what you could do with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1546-great-cthulhu","name":"Great Cthulhu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1546_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-22T07:44:21-08:00","id":1429509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Great Cthulhu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1409845-these-pages-are-knives-new-martial-arts-book?p=1429401#post1429401\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've enjoyed some of your previous works. If a player had a specific concept in mind I'd definitely point them at this collection.<br /> <br /> As an aside are you considering writing a pdf for sorcery spells? Sorcery is terribly under-served both officially and 3rd party. I'd like to see what you could do with it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'd reccomend Rand's Thousand Sanctioned Bestiary Sorcerer's entry for that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-23T10:12:20-08:00","id":1429640,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1409845-these-pages-are-knives-new-martial-arts-book?p=1429509#post1429509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd reccomend Rand's Thousand Sanctioned Bestiary Sorcerer's entry for that.</div> </div> </div> </div>The spells in that one are excellent (it's probably my favorite single PDF Rand has produced), which is all the more reason I hope he writes more sorcery material at some point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11237-jefepato","name":"Jefepato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-23T13:49:09-08:00","id":1429666,"title":"","content":"Let me give some thought to sorcery! Often what I write is dependent on what inspiration catches my attention long enough to get written, but if lots of people want sorcery it seems like a good way to make money. I just want to be careful so as to avoid writing something that winds up being displaced by an eventual sorcery book (when I could instead write something that will one day <i>supplement </i>an official sorcery book).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-23T16:43:14-08:00","id":1429690,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jefepato</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1409845-these-pages-are-knives-new-martial-arts-book?p=1429640#post1429640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The spells in that one are excellent (it's probably my favorite single PDF Rand has produced), which is all the more reason I hope he writes more sorcery material at some point.</div> </div> </div> </div>Third-ing the Thousand Sanctioned Beasts. My only complain with those books is there's a disappointing lack of proper beasts in the series. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-28T18:52:46-08:00","id":1433756,"title":"","content":"I've now added <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/344983\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Kingfisher Style</b></a> to the Vault.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-29T08:37:01-08:00","id":1433802,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rand Brittain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1409845-these-pages-are-knives-new-martial-arts-book?p=1433756#post1433756\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've now added <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/344983&amp;quot;]</a><b>Kingfisher Style</b>[/URL] to the Vault.</div> </div> </div> </div>Kind of an odd question, but here goes.<br /> Love your other works, definitely wanting to start collecting these. Is there one in particular you'd say exemplifies your goals/visions for the line?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-29T13:51:35-08:00","id":1433831,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SamuraiMujuru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1409845-these-pages-are-knives-new-martial-arts-book?p=1433802#post1433802\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Kind of an odd question, but here goes.<br /> Love your other works, definitely wanting to start collecting these. Is there one in particular you'd say exemplifies your goals/visions for the line?</div> </div> </div> </div>Peacock, Hedgehog, and Salamander are probably my favorites, if only because they build on my desire to make it clear to everybody that animal styles are cool and fun and people shouldn't feel obligated to make Celestial Peacock Style in order to be a &quot;real&quot; martial art.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}